UID:eeb02498c953899ec5adcf146049b9a0@events.yolocountylibrary.org
DESCRIPTION:Join local author and artist Lorie Topinka as she presents her
  latest book\, Chickens of the 5th Street Community Garden and the Rat War
 s. Learn how an author comes up with an idea for a book\, how the writing 
 process works\, and how to become an artist! The chickens from the story 
 will also be in attendance!\n\nLorie’s art will be on display at\n\nLogo
 s Books - 513 2nd St\, Davis\, CA 95616\n\nJune 30 to July 25
LOCATION:Blanchard Room\, Mary L Stephens Davis Branch Library
